{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game is a short, intense, replayable horror survival game that thrusts you into a heart-pounding scenario: evade a relentless giant snake determined to consume you. The game's primary mission is to locate navigation points. These points are crucial, revealing the location of the correct extraction pod \u2014 your only means of escape. There will be no hand-holding or arrows to guide the way, only a map and a compass to navigate through the different environments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you uncover navigation points, you'll gather various power-ups, each offering a temporary advantage vital for outsmarting the snake that stalks you. Moreover, each playthrough offers an entirely new experience. Starting locations, navigation points, power-ups, and even the correct extraction pod location are randomized every time you play. Your strategy must adapt with each new game, challenging you to think on your feet, take calculated risks, and maintain focus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your actions carefully, navigate smartly, and whatever you do, don't get digested. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE FIRST PERSON VIEW AS A THIRD PERSON VIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605900/extras/209eb183ff8b5b401320546b7cbb2bef.poster.avif?t=1769960246\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605900/extras/209eb183ff8b5b401320546b7cbb2bef.webm?t=1769960246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605900/extras/209eb183ff8b5b401320546b7cbb2bef.mp4?t=1769960246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Keeping an eye out is a good way not to get digested. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN ISLAND TO EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605900/extras/ec42eaf4011008c21e0c77bddb87ddd3.poster.avif?t=1769960246\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605900/extras/ec42eaf4011008c21e0c77bddb87ddd3.webm?t=1769960246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605900/extras/ec42eaf4011008c21e0c77bddb87ddd3.mp4?t=1769960246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Roam freely, but stay alert to the ever-looming danger of being digested. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WATCH YOUR STEP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605900/extras/20b0fd0de7921d9082cb29bc53ee0ea6.poster.avif?t=1769960246\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605900/extras/20b0fd0de7921d9082cb29bc53ee0ea6.webm?t=1769960246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605900/extras/20b0fd0de7921d9082cb29bc53ee0ea6.mp4?t=1769960246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You're only human. Stumbling around will get you digested. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE TERROR OF BEING CONSUMED ALIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605900/extras/d6b9e6a16f7c432171154c5b1d4fb06e.poster.avif?t=1769960246\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://s